# Collect frames from the camera topics and turn them into candidates and an obstacle map.

# Labels the result as the re-measurement taken after the vehicle parked, rather than the survey
# that chose where to park. It selects nothing here: every collect already throws the buffer away
# and waits for a whole fresh window, because frames taken before the goal was sent may have seen
# the arm moving through the view or been taken from somewhere the vehicle has left. The label is
# carried through to CloudResult.fresh so the two passes can be told apart downstream.
bool fresh
---
CloudResult cloud
---
string COLLECTING=collecting
string PROCESSING=processing
string stage
uint32 frames_collected
